## Part 3: Configure the Frontend

### Step 1: Set environment variables

Copy `.env.local.example` to `.env.local` in the project root and fill in your values:

```env
# Your Cloudflare Worker URL from Part 2, Step 3
VITE_METADATA_WORKER_URL=https://stash-metadata-fetcher.your-subdomain.workers.dev

# The token you set in Part 2, Step 2
VITE_METADATA_TOKEN=stash-secret-xyz-12345
```

If you skipped the Cloudflare Worker, leave these blank — the app will fall back to public proxies automatically.

### Step 2: Point the app at your backend

Open [src/lib/api.ts](src/lib/api.ts) and update `BASE_URL` to your API subdomain:

```typescript
const BASE_URL = 'https://api.yourdomain.com'
```

