## API Reference

All endpoints require an `Authorization: Bearer <jwt>` header unless marked public.

| Method | Path | Description |
|--------|------|-------------|
| POST | `/api/auth/register` | Register (public) |
| POST | `/api/auth/login` | Login (public) |
| POST | `/api/auth/verify-otp` | Verify OTP (public) |
| POST | `/api/auth/resend-otp` | Resend OTP (public) |
| GET  | `/api/auth/me` | Get current user |
| POST | `/api/auth/forgot-password` | Request password reset (public) |
| POST | `/api/auth/reset-password` | Reset password (public) |
| POST | `/api/backup/upload` | Save bookmark data |
| GET  | `/api/backup/latest` | Get most recent backup |
| GET  | `/api/backup/list` | List all backups |
| POST | `/api/thumbnails/upload` | Upload thumbnail image |
| GET  | `/api/thumbnails` | Get all thumbnail URLs |
| DELETE | `/api/thumbnails` | Delete thumbnails |

### Thumbnail upload

`POST /api/thumbnails/upload` — `multipart/form-data`

| Field | Type | Notes |
|-------|------|-------|
| `bookmark_id` | string | UUID of the bookmark |
| `image` | file | JPEG, PNG, or WebP; max 5 MB |

Response: `{ "url": "https://api.yourdomain.com/uploads/thumbnails/1/abc-123.jpg" }`
